# Line endings
#
# Text files are stored as LF in the repository and checked out as LF on every
# platform. The repo previously held a mix of CRLF and LF, which made unrelated
# edits show up as whole-file diffs depending on who touched them.
#
# LF in the working tree on Windows too: Git for Windows, VS Code, Ruby and Node
# all handle it, and it keeps SCSS/YAML/JS byte-identical across machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never convert, never diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary

# Fonts
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
